WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.915
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.185 --> 00:09.025
‎SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:35.665 --> 01:37.145
‎ADAPTED FROM ‎JIA JIN CHAI‎, ORIGINAL NOVEL

4
01:37.225 --> 01:39.025
‎BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

5
01:42.105 --> 01:45.705
XUANSHI PALACE

6
01:49.865 --> 01:50.905
Wei Rao,

7
01:54.385 --> 01:55.505
before we see the Emperor,

8
01:57.465 --> 01:58.705
do you have anything to tell me?

9
02:06.665 --> 02:07.705
I…

10
02:11.665 --> 02:15.825
Summoning the Heir to the Duke of Ying and his wife, Lady Wei.

11
02:19.105 --> 02:20.945
What do you want to hear from me, My Lord?

12
02:26.505 --> 02:29.265
Once we're inside the hall, you don't need to speak.

13
02:30.425 --> 02:31.265
I will handle it.

14
02:33.665 --> 02:35.065
XUANSHI PALACE

15
02:54.345 --> 02:57.225
Lu Zhuo pays his respects to Your Majesty.

16
02:59.825 --> 03:01.465
All right. Not a formal session today.

17
03:02.065 --> 03:04.265
There's no need for such formalities.

18
03:04.345 --> 03:05.185
You may rise.

19
03:10.505 --> 03:11.425
Lu Zhuo,

20
03:12.105 --> 03:13.945
I invited you both here today.

21
03:14.025 --> 03:15.865
I meant to act as a peacemaker

22
03:15.945 --> 03:20.145
to resolve the grudge and end the hostility among your three families.

23
03:20.945 --> 03:22.785
Prince Rong is His Majesty's brother.

24
03:23.705 --> 03:25.865
The Lu and Han families are pillars of the court.

25
03:26.505 --> 03:29.225
For the three families to harbor animosity and argue endlessly,

26
03:29.305 --> 03:31.785
how is that proper conduct for subjects?

27
03:32.625 --> 03:35.585
This must all be a misunderstanding.

28
03:35.665 --> 03:37.865
I would also like to ask Prince Rong

29
03:39.185 --> 03:40.625
what kind of misunderstanding it was

30
03:40.705 --> 03:43.145
that made you disregard etiquette and propriety

31
03:43.225 --> 03:44.865
to openly intrude into my ancestral temple.

32
03:49.625 --> 03:50.705
I am guilty.

33
03:50.785 --> 03:52.105
The servant, Anfu,

34
03:52.185 --> 03:54.145
accused them of hiding imperial ritual vessels.

35
03:54.745 --> 03:56.025
I dare not to act on my own,

36
03:56.105 --> 03:57.865
so I immediately reported it to Prince Rong.

37
03:57.945 --> 04:00.265
His Highness has a fiery temper.

38
04:00.345 --> 04:01.865
How can he tolerate such overstepping?

39
04:02.745 --> 04:04.545
He rushed straight to confront the Lu family.

40
04:04.625 --> 04:06.985
Who would have thought? It was actually that servant,

41
04:07.065 --> 04:08.825
mistreated by his masters,

42
04:09.865 --> 04:12.105
and made up a huge lie to frame the Lu family.

43
04:12.865 --> 04:15.185
All of this had nothing to do with Prince Rong.

44
04:15.265 --> 04:17.145
It was all my fault. I misjudged

45
04:17.225 --> 04:18.705
and trusted the wrong man.

46
04:18.785 --> 04:23.585
I deserve death. A thousand deaths.

47
04:24.185 --> 04:26.705
To think that Anfu, an illiterate servant,

48
04:27.225 --> 04:29.025
actually knew how to identify imperial vessels.

49
04:29.985 --> 04:31.745
This is truly an extraordinary tale.

50
04:33.545 --> 04:36.985
Lord Lu is right to lecture me. It was all my fault.

51
04:37.825 --> 04:40.105
Your Majesty, in my view,

52
04:40.185 --> 04:42.265
we must capture Anfu and torture him severely.

53
04:42.865 --> 04:45.225
I doubt he'll keep quiet about who's behind it.

54
04:45.305 --> 04:47.465
Why pretend, Lord Han?

55
04:48.265 --> 04:50.425
Don't you know Anfu was thrown into the imperial prison

56
04:51.585 --> 04:53.425
and then dropped dead right there?

57
04:54.625 --> 04:55.465
He is dead?

58
04:56.745 --> 04:59.105
This is clearly silencing a witness.

59
05:00.985 --> 05:02.185
Your Majesty,

60
05:02.265 --> 05:04.505
I request that the Commandant's Office look into this case.

61
05:05.025 --> 05:09.305
So the truth can come to light soon and clear the name of loyal subjects.

62
05:09.905 --> 05:13.225
Over a hundred people in the Lu family, they can all testify to it.

63
05:14.065 --> 05:15.385
You intruded into my ancestral temple,

64
05:15.465 --> 05:17.225
destroyed our spirit tablets, and insulted our ancestors.

65
05:17.905 --> 05:19.225
Which of these wronged you?

66
05:20.185 --> 05:22.505
How dare you shamelessly claim your name to be cleared?

67
05:22.585 --> 05:25.105
Lord Lu, it was all because I was foolish

68
05:25.185 --> 05:26.625
and deceived by others.

69
05:28.185 --> 05:29.705
Punish me however you like,

70
05:31.265 --> 05:32.305
it's your call.

71
05:33.425 --> 05:34.305
All right.

72
05:35.145 --> 05:38.185
There are no witnesses, only verbal claims.

73
05:39.265 --> 05:41.305
Whose side do you expect me to believe?

74
05:42.425 --> 05:45.465
In this hall today, there is more than one victim.

75
05:46.785 --> 05:49.065
Lady Wei, you were also wronged.

76
05:49.145 --> 05:51.705
I can have Han family compensate you.

77
05:52.745 --> 05:53.985
So, Your Majesty,

78
05:54.905 --> 05:56.705
are you shielding Prince Rong and Han Liao?

79
05:57.825 --> 05:58.665
Insolence!

80
05:59.505 --> 06:00.505
Lu Zhuo,

81
06:01.145 --> 06:03.545
His Majesty knows your grandfather is stubborn

82
06:03.625 --> 06:05.145
and inflexible,

83
06:05.225 --> 06:07.065
which is why he asked you here to make peace.

84
06:07.145 --> 06:10.945
So, you also want to go against His Majesty's kindness?

85
06:11.625 --> 06:13.385
I have decided on the compensation.

86
06:14.785 --> 06:15.745
I only ask for Your Majesty's approval.

87
06:16.505 --> 06:17.345
Speak.

88
06:19.345 --> 06:22.945
I beg Your Majesty to grant permission to chop off Prince Rong's left foot

89
06:24.505 --> 06:27.185
and both of Lord Han's feet as compensation.

90
06:33.905 --> 06:39.145
ZHAOYANG PALACE

91
06:42.905 --> 06:45.665
Your Ladyship, are you worried that you idea to His Majesty won't work?

92
06:47.385 --> 06:49.585
The Empress Dowager did her best to protect Prince Rong.

93
06:49.665 --> 06:51.345
His Majesty didn't want to break with his mother

94
06:51.425 --> 06:54.305
and bear the name of an unfilial son, so he could only release Prince Rong.

95
06:54.905 --> 06:57.185
Besides, everything is over with the witness dead.

96
06:57.705 --> 06:59.865
No matter how dissatisfied the Lu family is,

97
06:59.945 --> 07:01.545
they cannot oppose the Empress Dowager.

98
07:02.225 --> 07:04.345
Then you must be worried about Yinggu, who left the palace.

99
07:06.225 --> 07:08.385
Yinggu is just visiting my mother at Xianzhuang.

100
07:08.465 --> 07:09.985
Why would I worry about her?

101
07:10.945 --> 07:12.705
Stop being cheeky here.

102
07:12.785 --> 07:14.945
Hurry to Xuanshi Palace and see if Rao has arrived.

103
07:15.545 --> 07:16.905
Yes, I'm going now.

104
07:16.985 --> 07:18.625
Go quickly.

105
07:19.425 --> 07:22.665
ZHAOYANG PALACE

106
07:24.665 --> 07:26.145
You vicious woman,

107
07:26.225 --> 07:28.505
-how dare you! -Shut up.

108
07:29.385 --> 07:33.705
Let her talk. I want to hear it. I have pardoned them.

109
07:34.425 --> 07:37.425
What crime are you charging them with to cut off their feet?

110
07:38.785 --> 07:39.825
Wei Rao.

111
07:44.825 --> 07:45.665
Your Majesty,

112
07:46.345 --> 07:47.825
The witness, Anfu, is dead,

113
07:48.545 --> 07:50.425
making it hard to prove Han's false accusation.

114
07:51.105 --> 07:53.385
But the innocent woman abducted by Lord Han is still alive

115
07:53.905 --> 07:55.345
and can testify at any time.

116
07:56.745 --> 07:58.265
Lord Han's violated two laws.

117
07:59.065 --> 08:01.865
One, abetting others in the commission of a crime.

118
08:01.945 --> 08:05.185
He forcibly abducted a commoner woman and schemed to do harm.

119
08:05.265 --> 08:08.225
Two, the guilty injuring the innocent.

120
08:08.305 --> 08:10.425
The Lu family tried to save her and got beaten instead.

121
08:10.505 --> 08:12.905
For the Han family, this doubles the offense.

122
08:13.505 --> 08:15.465
But I was the one got beaten and injured.

123
08:15.545 --> 08:16.745
By our laws,

124
08:17.545 --> 08:19.185
anyone who abducts a woman without cause

125
08:19.905 --> 08:23.785
her rescuer can kill you on the spot with impunity.

126
08:24.665 --> 08:25.505
Your Majesty!

127
08:25.585 --> 08:29.225
If a commoner abducts a woman, a left foot shall be cut off.

128
08:29.305 --> 08:32.865
For an official, that makes it worse, and both his feet get cut off.

129
08:34.345 --> 08:36.865
Accomplices share the same guilt as the abductor.

130
08:37.385 --> 08:38.825
Lord Han bore full responsibility.

131
08:38.904 --> 08:41.144
Prince Rong was deceived and acted as an accomplice.

132
08:41.225 --> 08:42.625
The mastermind loses both feet,

133
08:43.664 --> 08:46.505
and the accomplice loses his left foot. This is already lenient treatment.

134
08:47.665 --> 08:50.305
When a prince breaks the law, he is as guilty as a commoner.

135
08:50.985 --> 08:54.585
If Your Majesty spares them today, it tells the people of the realm that

136
08:54.665 --> 08:55.625
abducting is guiltless,

137
08:56.625 --> 08:58.505
and flouting the law carries no fault.

138
08:58.585 --> 09:01.065
If a royal brother and your favorite subject defy the law,

139
09:01.145 --> 09:04.665
who in the realm will obey the laws of the state

140
09:04.745 --> 09:06.105
and follow Your Majesty's commands in the future?

141
09:06.185 --> 09:08.625
Shut up! I'll chop you down.

142
09:09.905 --> 09:10.825
You…

143
09:13.705 --> 09:14.705
Your Majesty, forgive me.

144
09:14.785 --> 09:16.825
It is not the Lu family demanding these three feet.

145
09:17.825 --> 09:19.505
It is the state's law that demands them.

146
09:20.025 --> 09:22.825
To uphold Your Majesty's authority and imperial dignity,

147
09:23.345 --> 09:24.425
it has to be done.

148
09:27.785 --> 09:30.585
Well done. Well said.

149
09:31.665 --> 09:32.825
Though sharp-tongued,

150
09:33.425 --> 09:35.145
what you say is well-reasoned.

151
09:37.105 --> 09:39.665
However, my word is final, and I have promised the Empress Dowager

152
09:40.545 --> 09:41.985
that I will pardon them.

153
09:42.065 --> 09:44.145
What do you propose, then?

154
09:45.425 --> 09:47.305
Then, please grant permission, Your Majesty,

155
09:47.825 --> 09:51.545
allowing Prince Rong and the Han family redeem their crimes with gold.

156
09:51.625 --> 09:53.345
-How arrogant! -Granted.

157
09:54.225 --> 09:55.345
What?

158
09:56.545 --> 09:58.305
Do you wish to lose your left foot instead?

159
10:01.625 --> 10:02.745
I believe

160
10:03.265 --> 10:05.745
Prince Rong's new estate in the east of the city

161
10:05.825 --> 10:07.625
-will suffice. -You!

162
10:15.345 --> 10:16.185
Take it.

163
10:17.225 --> 10:18.305
Lord Han.

164
10:20.265 --> 10:21.585
I am willing to offer 20,000 gold.

165
10:22.425 --> 10:24.865
I hear the Han family has 500 mu of fertile land

166
10:24.945 --> 10:26.545
at the foot of Mount Yaowang.

167
10:29.305 --> 10:30.465
Only enough for his left foot.

168
10:32.985 --> 10:35.745
Then I ask Your Majesty to chop off Lord Han's right foot instead.

169
10:37.305 --> 10:39.945
The mountain estate and 300 servants included,

170
10:40.545 --> 10:42.465
all yours, your Ladyship.

171
10:43.345 --> 10:47.385
If only you would show mercy and spare my right foot.

172
10:49.105 --> 10:51.185
Death may be spared, yet punishment cannot be evaded.

173
10:52.225 --> 10:55.025
Your Majesty, please bear witness for me. Don't let them deny it.

174
10:55.985 --> 10:58.385
Your gold and land may have saved your feet

175
10:58.905 --> 11:01.745
but serving a month of penal labor is still unavoidable.

176
11:01.825 --> 11:04.265
-You… -Fine.

177
11:04.865 --> 11:07.265
We shall this day bear witness on behalf of all three families.

178
11:08.065 --> 11:10.105
Prince Rong shall forfeit one year of stipend.

179
11:10.985 --> 11:13.425
Han Liao shall serve one month of hard labor.

180
11:14.025 --> 11:16.465
If anyone break or deny it,

181
11:16.545 --> 11:19.385
I will chop off a left foot from them.

182
11:20.985 --> 11:22.265
All clear now?

183
11:24.305 --> 11:26.025
-Yes. -Yes.

184
11:37.465 --> 11:40.745
XUANSHI PALACE

185
11:40.825 --> 11:42.265
This is my first time seeing

186
11:42.785 --> 11:44.745
anyone dare to bargain in the Xuanshi Palace.

187
11:45.345 --> 11:47.865
If His Majesty simply wanted to favor Prince Rong,

188
11:48.385 --> 11:51.265
he could have just issued an edict. Why ask us to come here?

189
11:52.425 --> 11:55.745
He invited you, meaning he wants a justice for the Lu family.

190
11:56.465 --> 11:59.225
If justice cannot be settled with lives,

191
12:00.545 --> 12:02.265
then it shall be compensated with wealth.

192
12:02.905 --> 12:04.825
Either way, we can't suffer for nothing.

193
12:04.905 --> 12:06.905
As for whether to show mercy,

194
12:08.105 --> 12:10.105
His Majesty only said no sentence today,

195
12:10.705 --> 12:14.545
not that the Lu family can't take revenge in the future.

196
12:15.265 --> 12:18.905
Grandfather would certainly not accept such worldly possessions.

197
12:20.425 --> 12:22.265
Lu as the main victim does not want them.

198
12:22.785 --> 12:24.345
I, as the minor victim, certainly do.

199
12:24.425 --> 12:27.345
I don't have your family's wealth and power.

200
12:28.305 --> 12:29.905
Demanding them for yourself, huh?

201
12:31.025 --> 12:32.865
No wonder you haggled over every bit.

202
12:33.745 --> 12:34.865
You really are…

203
12:35.585 --> 12:37.465
Greetings, Lord Lu and Lady Lu.

204
12:37.545 --> 12:40.105
My mistress invites you for a conversation, Lady Lu.

205
12:40.905 --> 12:42.305
May I ask who your mistress is?

206
12:42.825 --> 12:44.825
My mistress is Lady Li of Zhaoyang Palace.

207
12:54.945 --> 12:56.625
You haven't eaten anything all day,

208
12:57.785 --> 12:59.385
and waited in full dress for two hours

209
13:00.385 --> 13:01.905
Your stomach ailment has recurred.

210
13:05.905 --> 13:07.425
My wife is feeling unwell.

211
13:07.505 --> 13:08.585
I'm afraid she might embarrass herself in front of your Ladyship.

212
13:09.305 --> 13:10.305
We must come pay our respects another day.

213
13:10.385 --> 13:11.785
Please ask Lady Li to forgive us.

214
13:13.945 --> 13:15.345
Rao.

215
13:17.985 --> 13:19.025
Rao.

216
13:40.905 --> 13:41.985
Rao.

217
13:43.785 --> 13:44.665
Lord Lu.

218
13:45.585 --> 13:46.585
Pardon my intrusion.

219
13:49.785 --> 13:50.785
Is she sick?

220
13:51.385 --> 13:53.305
How can she bear the jolt of a carriage while ill?

221
13:53.385 --> 13:55.545
Bring her to my palace at once, and ask for an imperial physician.

222
13:56.385 --> 13:57.545
This is the imperial palace,

223
13:58.425 --> 14:00.625
so I dare not breach etiquette. Please return, Your Ladyship.

224
14:01.345 --> 14:03.865
Mother and daughter have been separated for years with few reunions.

225
14:04.385 --> 14:06.625
A sudden meeting inevitably causes distress.

226
14:07.385 --> 14:08.625
Please do not blame her, Lady Li.

227
14:08.705 --> 14:10.985
Too many ears here. Not the place to talk.

228
14:11.785 --> 14:13.265
If your Ladyship wishes to meet,

229
14:13.345 --> 14:14.465
please find another time.

230
14:15.345 --> 14:16.865
I will take Rao back home first.

231
14:16.945 --> 14:19.305
-I won't allow it. -Please wait, Lord Lu.

232
14:24.945 --> 14:27.985
My Lord, His Majesty's got a unfinished weiqi game.

233
14:28.065 --> 14:29.265
He asked you back to the palace.

234
14:29.945 --> 14:32.025
Lady Lu may rest in Zhaoyang Palace for now.

235
14:32.105 --> 14:34.025
My wife's old illness has suddenly flared up.

236
14:35.225 --> 14:36.305
I will see His Majesty right after I take her home.

237
14:37.345 --> 14:38.785
Apologize to His Majesty on my behalf.

238
14:38.865 --> 14:41.905
Lady Lu is ill. We've got plenty of imperial physicians here.

239
14:41.985 --> 14:44.625
How can His Majesty be made to wait for a subject?

240
14:44.705 --> 14:46.145
Lu Zhuo,

241
14:47.665 --> 14:51.505
you repeatedly stop us from being close.

242
14:52.105 --> 14:53.945
What are your intentions?

243
14:55.625 --> 14:56.585
Pay no attention.

244
14:56.665 --> 15:00.625
Lord Lu, you must not. You must not defy an imperial decree.

245
15:06.505 --> 15:07.385
Put me down.

246
15:08.385 --> 15:09.385
Wei Rao.

247
15:22.905 --> 15:24.225
There is no need, Lady Li.

248
15:25.585 --> 15:27.985
His Majesty must asked for you with something important.

249
15:28.585 --> 15:30.225
Do not delay your work for me.

250
15:32.145 --> 15:33.665
I will wait for you at Zhaoyang Palace.

251
15:34.705 --> 15:35.625
Alright.

252
15:36.545 --> 15:39.185
I will pick you up right after I finish.

253
15:42.345 --> 15:43.985
Go on and tend to your affairs.

254
15:44.065 --> 15:45.865
I will take good care of Rao.

255
15:45.945 --> 15:50.025
Lady Li, palace rules state that family visits are limited to a quarter.

256
15:50.105 --> 15:51.465
We must not delay.

257
15:51.545 --> 15:53.585
Alright, spare me the nagging.

258
15:54.105 --> 15:56.425
Someone, bring my palanquin.

259
15:57.105 --> 15:59.545
Lady Lu will ride with me.

260
15:59.625 --> 16:00.785
Let's go.

261
16:06.025 --> 16:07.225
Lord Lu,

262
16:08.865 --> 16:09.905
this way, please.

263
16:23.065 --> 16:24.985
THE HOUR OF WEI

264
16:30.905 --> 16:31.985
Your Ladyship,

265
16:32.065 --> 16:33.305
this stomach ailment is a chronic condition

266
16:33.385 --> 16:34.465
caused by years of irregular eating

267
16:35.065 --> 16:38.665
and suppressed emotions. It cannot be cured overnight.

268
16:38.745 --> 16:40.465
We must use acupuncture

269
16:40.545 --> 16:42.625
along with carefully prepared medicinal food.

270
16:42.705 --> 16:45.665
To cure this illness, we should go slowly rather than rush.

271
16:46.345 --> 16:47.425
Go write the prescription.

272
16:48.105 --> 16:49.065
Yes.

273
16:53.105 --> 16:54.385
Not my place to sit here.

274
16:59.505 --> 17:01.265
Darned the Earl of Cheng'an's residence.

275
17:01.345 --> 17:03.505
How did they take care of you

276
17:04.424 --> 17:06.625
to let you suffer from such an illness?

277
17:07.585 --> 17:10.145
Was Old Madam Wei bad to you?

278
17:11.265 --> 17:13.224
Or did Lady Guo dare to treat you harshly?

279
17:14.385 --> 17:16.625
Or was it that useless uncle of yours?

280
17:16.704 --> 17:18.345
No matter who it was,

281
17:20.184 --> 17:21.424
Mother will settle this for you.

282
17:22.025 --> 17:26.025
Grandmother, Uncle, and Aunt were all very good to me.

283
17:49.545 --> 17:50.385
Rao,

284
17:51.185 --> 17:52.025
turn around.

285
17:54.065 --> 17:55.505
Let me look at you.

286
18:14.185 --> 18:15.785
Good to you?

287
18:17.425 --> 18:20.225
If they were good to you, would you be so skinny?

288
18:21.065 --> 18:23.465
Would they make you marry a dying man for luck?

289
18:23.985 --> 18:25.345
Do not lie to me.

290
18:26.865 --> 18:29.985
I broke my way out of the suffocating mansion.

291
18:30.625 --> 18:33.345
Those people speak sweet words,

292
18:34.025 --> 18:37.385
but they are full of hypocrisy and schemes.

293
18:39.785 --> 18:41.025
Rao,

294
18:41.625 --> 18:43.105
your face is so pale.

295
18:44.305 --> 18:46.865
Your hands are so cold. Are you trembling?

296
18:57.305 --> 18:58.305
Rao,

297
18:59.145 --> 19:02.745
I know you hate me, blame me

298
19:02.825 --> 19:05.065
that you don't want to see me. I know.

299
19:07.465 --> 19:08.505
But…

300
19:10.665 --> 19:13.225
I miss you every day.

301
19:14.425 --> 19:16.505
I have never forgotten you for a single day.

302
19:18.465 --> 19:19.505
My daughter…

303
19:21.625 --> 19:23.425
You are my daughter.

304
19:30.425 --> 19:33.065
Rao, do not cry. Do not cry.

305
19:33.785 --> 19:34.905
It is all my fault.

306
19:34.985 --> 19:37.505
How did I end up making you cry?

307
19:38.825 --> 19:42.305
You were still young when I left, so you do not remember me.

308
19:44.825 --> 19:46.465
But every time your grandmother

309
19:47.505 --> 19:49.385
took you to the Eldest Princess's Residence,

310
19:52.345 --> 19:54.385
I would go and secretly take a look at you.

311
19:55.865 --> 19:59.665
I know you, my daughter, is a real beauty.

312
20:00.425 --> 20:02.625
I knew you were betrothed to Lu Zhuo.

313
20:03.225 --> 20:05.025
What I did not know

314
20:06.105 --> 20:08.065
was that the Empress Dowager, the hag,

315
20:09.185 --> 20:11.265
would make you marry him to ward off bad luck.

316
20:11.345 --> 20:14.345
By the time I found out about all this, it was already too late.

317
20:14.425 --> 20:15.625
Lady Li.

318
20:15.705 --> 20:18.585
She is just a narrow-minded hag.

319
20:19.105 --> 20:20.345
If she hadn't kept interfering

320
20:20.945 --> 20:22.385
how could we be seperated

321
20:22.465 --> 20:25.665
for so many years and hardly ever seen each other?

322
20:26.945 --> 20:28.585
She dislikes the Zhou family.

323
20:29.105 --> 20:30.705
How could she treat you well?

324
20:32.425 --> 20:35.905
Thankfully, Lu Zhuo was not destined for a short life.

325
20:37.425 --> 20:38.705
Otherwise,

326
20:38.785 --> 20:41.425
you would have become a widow right after getting married,

327
20:42.625 --> 20:44.665
following right in my footsteps.

328
20:48.145 --> 20:48.985
Aman,

329
20:49.585 --> 20:51.385
Rao was terrified and hasn't eaten anything

330
20:51.465 --> 20:53.065
which triggered her illness.

331
20:53.865 --> 20:56.105
Go and prepare some pastries.

332
20:56.185 --> 20:57.505
Yes.

333
21:01.745 --> 21:04.585
Just have a little bit with me, alright?

334
21:08.465 --> 21:11.425
ZHAOYANG PALACE

335
21:23.105 --> 21:23.945
Here.

336
21:40.345 --> 21:41.345
It is not to your taste?

337
21:44.385 --> 21:47.065
Not as delicious as the ones at Wei Residence?

338
21:48.985 --> 21:50.585
If you do not like it, leave it here.

339
21:51.185 --> 21:52.545
I will have them make it again.

340
21:53.145 --> 21:55.705
Your Ladyship, it is almost the end for the visit.

341
22:00.625 --> 22:02.985
Aman, go fetch my things.

342
22:11.945 --> 22:12.865
Look,

343
22:12.945 --> 22:15.705
these are all my fine treasures. Look.

344
22:15.785 --> 22:18.465
Look at these. Which one do you like?

345
22:21.665 --> 22:22.785
Is this one pretty?

346
22:31.665 --> 22:32.505
No.

347
22:40.105 --> 22:41.225
Do not move.

348
22:44.425 --> 22:45.665
It looks beautiful.

349
22:47.025 --> 22:50.785
Not just these. There are also gold and jade treasures in the storeroom.

350
22:51.305 --> 22:52.665
I'm leaving all of them for you.

351
22:55.545 --> 22:56.385
Back then,

352
22:57.265 --> 22:59.185
if he hadn't promised

353
22:59.865 --> 23:02.745
that he would treat you well

354
23:03.545 --> 23:06.065
and stand up for you when your father is gone,

355
23:07.225 --> 23:09.145
who would care to live in this golden cage,

356
23:10.785 --> 23:13.945
controlled by others all day long. Nowhere to be free.

357
23:14.665 --> 23:15.625
All these things

358
23:16.625 --> 23:19.145
-should be his compensation to you. -Your Ladyship, mind your words.

359
23:22.785 --> 23:25.225
Is calling me your Mother too much to ask?

360
23:35.065 --> 23:37.065
Your Ladyship, the time has come.

361
23:37.145 --> 23:39.385
It is time to see her out of the palace.

362
23:42.665 --> 23:45.345
-Rao, -I am grateful for your immense kindness.

363
23:45.425 --> 23:48.425
I shall take my leave now. Please take care of yourself.

364
23:49.305 --> 23:50.225
Rao.

365
23:52.025 --> 23:53.105
Rao.

366
23:54.985 --> 23:57.745
-Rao! -Your Ladyship, the palace has its rules.

367
23:57.825 --> 23:59.505
Any further delay will disturb the Empress Dowager.

368
23:59.585 --> 24:01.385
That would also be bad for Lady Lu.

369
24:01.465 --> 24:02.985
Please don't make things difficult for me.

370
24:03.065 --> 24:03.945
Get out!

371
24:05.905 --> 24:06.945
Rao.

372
24:07.745 --> 24:09.185
Rao.

373
24:14.065 --> 24:15.425
ZHAOYANG PALACE

374
24:54.545 --> 24:57.665
Look at you. You longed so much to see your daughter,

375
24:58.345 --> 25:00.425
yet now that you have, are you still not happy?

376
25:00.945 --> 25:03.505
Go away! I never want to see you again.

377
25:03.585 --> 25:04.785
How impudent!

378
25:04.865 --> 25:07.145
Here. Strike me.

379
25:07.225 --> 25:08.105
Once I am dead,

380
25:09.225 --> 25:11.305
have your gray-haired wet nurse come into the palace,

381
25:12.145 --> 25:14.465
carry me out rolling in a tattered mat, then bury me.

382
25:15.945 --> 25:18.705
That would end our ill-fated bond in this life.

383
25:20.305 --> 25:21.505
In the next life,

384
25:22.025 --> 25:24.305
even if I were born an animal,

385
25:24.385 --> 25:26.625
I would never live in this golden cage of yours.

386
25:27.145 --> 25:28.785
I would rather have thorn hairpins and coarse clothes,

387
25:29.385 --> 25:30.905
plain tea and simple rice.

388
25:31.785 --> 25:34.905
It'd be better than being separated from my child and becoming strangers.

389
25:34.985 --> 25:36.665
It'd be far better than

390
25:37.185 --> 25:39.665
the day my beauty fades and love wanes,

391
25:39.745 --> 25:40.985
and I become tiresome to others.

392
25:42.505 --> 25:44.585
Come, let me look at you.

393
25:45.185 --> 25:47.225
You are so beautiful,

394
25:47.305 --> 25:49.785
so how could you have lost beauty and faded love?

395
25:49.865 --> 25:51.385
Nonsense.

396
25:51.465 --> 25:52.865
Then why do you forbid me from seeing my daughter?

397
25:55.745 --> 26:00.505
Fu, she looks too much like her birth father.

398
26:00.585 --> 26:03.825
I don't want you dwelling on him.

399
26:04.545 --> 26:06.105
It just makes you sad for no reason.

400
26:08.025 --> 26:10.665
She could have been our daughter.

401
26:10.745 --> 26:11.945
Whose fault is all this?

402
26:15.065 --> 26:18.185
All right, it is all my fault.

403
26:18.265 --> 26:20.025
You promised me

404
26:20.665 --> 26:23.305
that you would treat my daughter as your own,

405
26:24.185 --> 26:26.905
that you would make her the most noble young lady in the world.

406
26:27.785 --> 26:28.945
Did you keep your promise?

407
26:32.505 --> 26:35.265
Fu, I asked you to stay away

408
26:36.385 --> 26:37.585
is to protect her.

409
26:39.145 --> 26:40.385
Protect her?

410
26:41.265 --> 26:44.425
You are clearly afraid of the Empress Dowager in Changle Palace.

411
26:44.505 --> 26:46.985
Yet you know very well.

412
26:47.065 --> 26:48.785
Even if you are the Emperor.

413
26:48.865 --> 26:51.865
Even if you have given all your filial devotion

414
26:51.945 --> 26:53.865
and offered everything eagerly at her feet.

415
26:54.545 --> 26:57.825
She could only see her eldest son and Prince Rong in her eyes.

416
26:57.905 --> 26:59.305
There is no place for you, isn't it?

417
26:59.385 --> 27:01.625
Zhou Fu, you've gone too far!

418
27:01.705 --> 27:03.905
Because she is your mother,

419
27:03.985 --> 27:07.265
I yielded in everything and backed down at every turn.

420
27:07.345 --> 27:09.545
But I am a mother, too.

421
27:10.625 --> 27:11.705
From now on,

422
27:12.225 --> 27:15.265
I will never let Rao suffer anything like the lucky marriage.

423
27:16.505 --> 27:17.985
If anyone dares to bully my daughter,

424
27:18.585 --> 27:21.625
I will take up swords and fight the whole world.

425
27:21.705 --> 27:24.025
I will kill every single one who comes.

426
27:24.105 --> 27:25.545
Try me if you don't believe it.

427
27:27.025 --> 27:28.345
Fu, you…

428
27:42.305 --> 27:43.385
Aunt,

429
27:43.945 --> 27:46.145
you haven't had anything to eat or drink all day.

430
27:46.225 --> 27:47.825
Please have some.

431
27:54.785 --> 27:58.305
EMPRESS

432
28:00.025 --> 28:03.665
EMPRESS DOWAGER

433
28:07.345 --> 28:08.425
Aunt.

434
28:16.905 --> 28:19.465
Mother, you don't need to worry anymore.

435
28:19.985 --> 28:22.065
His Majesty has already pardoned Prince Rong.

436
28:22.985 --> 28:24.105
What?

437
28:26.025 --> 28:27.385
His Majesty pardoned Xiao?

438
28:29.265 --> 28:30.425
That's not right.

439
28:30.505 --> 28:36.905
Earlier, he was furious and determined to punish Xiao severely.

440
28:36.985 --> 28:40.145
How could he suddenly change his mind?

441
28:40.745 --> 28:44.225
We have Lady Li to thank for that. Thanks to her persuasive words,

442
28:44.905 --> 28:46.785
His Majesty changed his mind.

443
28:47.425 --> 28:51.785
What good intentions could the scheming temptress have?

444
28:52.585 --> 28:55.305
It's just to curry favor with you, Aunt.

445
28:55.905 --> 28:57.785
Who asked you to be out of favor?

446
28:57.865 --> 29:00.985
Pulling a long face all day, even I hate looking at it,

447
29:01.585 --> 29:03.385
let alone the Emperor.

448
29:03.465 --> 29:08.265
If you won his heart, you should be the one today to reconcile those brothers

449
29:09.785 --> 29:11.785
It should have been your duty as the Empress.

450
29:11.865 --> 29:16.665
That is only because I come from your clan

451
29:17.705 --> 29:19.705
and was handpicked by you,

452
29:20.505 --> 29:22.505
which displeases His Majesty in every way.

453
29:22.585 --> 29:24.385
Empress, you had better hold your tongue.

454
29:24.905 --> 29:28.665
Lady Li persuaded His Majesty to restore fraternal harmony

455
29:28.745 --> 29:30.145
which is a good thing after all.

456
29:30.745 --> 29:32.745
Will you be happy if brothers become sworn enemies

457
29:32.825 --> 29:35.025
and Mother couldn't eat?

458
29:38.825 --> 29:40.825
Empress Dowager, His Majesty sent an edict.

459
29:48.185 --> 29:51.305
IMPERIAL EDICT

460
29:53.105 --> 29:55.025
To show special favor to Lady Li,

461
29:55.105 --> 29:56.425
His Majesty bestows her the title of Lady of Bright Deportment,

462
29:56.505 --> 29:58.345
meaning "manifesting virtue".

463
29:58.425 --> 30:00.385
The title equals that of the Chancellor.

464
30:00.465 --> 30:02.865
The rank equals to a feudal king, governing all consorts,

465
30:02.945 --> 30:04.425
second only to the Empress.

466
30:04.505 --> 30:05.905
The imperial edict was delivered to Changle Palace,

467
30:05.985 --> 30:07.625
and the Empress Dowager approved it.

468
30:07.705 --> 30:10.105
The formal decree will be issued tomorrow.

469
30:13.185 --> 30:16.225
Congratulations, Lady of Bright Deportment.

470
30:26.345 --> 30:27.625
ZHAOYANG PALACE

471
30:27.705 --> 30:30.305
Lady Li of Bright Deportment.

472
30:30.985 --> 30:33.385
Yinggu, you are always the most composed.

473
30:33.465 --> 30:35.265
What has panicked you so?

474
30:36.905 --> 30:39.785
Could it be that my mother is unwell?

475
30:39.865 --> 30:41.225
Lady Li, please dismiss everyone.

476
30:41.305 --> 30:43.425
I have a matter of grave importance to report.

477
30:55.505 --> 30:56.425
Wei Rao.

478
31:00.585 --> 31:04.385
I haven't thanked you yet, My Lord, for defending me in the palace.

479
31:06.625 --> 31:07.705
Grandmother said,

480
31:08.425 --> 31:11.265
since you fought for all the compensation from the Hans,

481
31:12.025 --> 31:13.105
it's all yours to handle.

482
31:14.465 --> 31:15.545
Understood.

483
31:17.905 --> 31:19.505
How do you plan to handle those things?

484
31:22.545 --> 31:25.385
Even if Han Liao honestly hands over the deeds,

485
31:26.185 --> 31:27.545
to make them truly belong to you,

486
31:28.345 --> 31:30.745
you must go to the relevant offices to re-deed them

487
31:30.825 --> 31:31.665
and transfer tax obligations.

488
31:32.265 --> 31:33.505
There are many details involved.

489
31:34.625 --> 31:36.425
-If you need help… -No need to trouble you.

490
31:38.025 --> 31:39.065
I have my own help.

491
31:47.425 --> 31:49.105
Transferring tax deeds is quite troublesome.

492
31:49.185 --> 31:50.905
I wonder who she asked for help.

493
31:52.745 --> 31:54.265
Her next husband, of course.

494
31:56.065 --> 31:57.105
Husband…

495
31:59.025 --> 32:00.025
Husband?

496
32:07.625 --> 32:09.905
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

497
32:28.625 --> 32:31.185
-Does it look good? -It looks really good.

498
32:31.265 --> 32:33.265
As beautiful as a celestial fairy.

499
32:34.145 --> 32:36.185
Bitao, what do you think?

500
32:36.865 --> 32:38.825
The finest silk in the world

501
32:39.345 --> 32:43.985
and the most luxurious jewels cannot compare to your radiance.

502
32:44.705 --> 32:49.225
In my heart, even in coarse linen without adornment,

503
32:49.745 --> 32:52.665
you are still you, as grand as ever, My Lady.

504
33:06.105 --> 33:07.105
Let's go.

505
33:17.665 --> 33:18.985
I won't need you to follow today.

506
33:21.665 --> 33:22.745
My Lady…

507
33:50.425 --> 33:51.385
This way.

508
34:00.385 --> 34:01.745
Imperial decrees are hard to disobey.

509
34:01.825 --> 34:05.305
Even someone as noble as Lord Han has to serve a full month of hard labor.

510
34:06.265 --> 34:08.425
Doing hard labor by day and guarding the gate by night.

511
34:09.105 --> 34:11.145
-Get lost! -Look.

512
34:12.065 --> 34:12.985
He's right over there.

513
34:23.744 --> 34:25.865
You look so miserable, Lord Han.

514
34:27.945 --> 34:29.625
Isn't this all thanks to you?

515
34:29.705 --> 34:30.985
Is it?

516
34:31.945 --> 34:33.065
Not at all.

517
34:33.905 --> 34:35.344
It's all my own doing.

518
34:35.425 --> 34:37.145
I can't blame you, Lady Wei Rao.

519
34:37.225 --> 34:39.344
Who are you to call her Lady Wei Rao?

520
34:39.425 --> 34:41.585
You call her that and I am not allowed?

521
34:42.905 --> 34:45.344
I am no friend to Lu Zhuo.

522
34:46.465 --> 34:47.744
Not my place to call her my buddy's wife.

523
34:49.505 --> 34:51.185
"Sister-in-law" isn't right either.

524
34:51.824 --> 34:54.145
Lu Zhuo's out of my league to be a brother.

525
34:56.385 --> 34:58.545
Better to call you Lady Wei Rao.

526
34:58.625 --> 34:59.505
Friendly enough.

527
35:01.225 --> 35:02.865
You still got the energy to argue, I see.

528
35:03.385 --> 35:05.545
It seems this work is too easy.

529
35:06.065 --> 35:07.585
I knew you'd come.

530
35:08.185 --> 35:10.345
I wouldn't pass up a chance

531
35:10.865 --> 35:12.465
to kick someone when they're down either.

532
35:13.745 --> 35:15.385
So I prepared in advance.

533
35:16.185 --> 35:17.025
Men.

534
35:25.825 --> 35:27.665
The deeds for 500 mu of good farmland,

535
35:28.185 --> 35:30.745
for my grand estate at the foot of Mount Yaowang,

536
35:30.825 --> 35:32.225
and the indentures for 300 servants.

537
35:32.905 --> 35:34.105
They are all here.

538
35:34.185 --> 35:37.145
This is property confiscated from your family.

539
35:37.225 --> 35:38.665
Handing it over is only right.

540
35:39.185 --> 35:40.065
Saves me the trouble.

541
35:40.145 --> 35:41.625
Higher.

542
35:42.345 --> 35:44.425
I sincerely gift all of this to you, Lady Wei Rao.

543
35:45.465 --> 35:46.985
I've handled all official procedures.

544
35:47.665 --> 35:49.025
You just need to take ownership.

545
35:49.105 --> 35:50.265
LAND DEED

546
35:50.945 --> 35:52.265
Such a grand gesture.

547
35:54.025 --> 35:56.425
You parted with your wealth so readily, Lord Han.

548
35:57.065 --> 35:58.425
Are you asking me for a favor?

549
36:03.585 --> 36:05.905
Parting with wealth is temporary pain,

550
36:05.985 --> 36:08.545
unlike this hard labor that grinds a man down.

551
36:08.625 --> 36:10.265
After just one day,

552
36:10.345 --> 36:13.025
my shoulders and back are covered in cuts.

553
36:14.105 --> 36:16.105
The soles of my feet are raw too.

554
36:17.945 --> 36:21.465
If I really do this for a month, I'm afraid I won't be recognizable.

555
36:21.545 --> 36:26.625
So, I ask that you be willing to intercede on my behalf.

556
36:27.745 --> 36:32.305
Just a word. I only need one word to spare me from this hard labor.

557
36:33.625 --> 36:35.825
And I will reward you handsomely.

558
36:35.905 --> 36:37.145
You're dreaming.

559
36:39.905 --> 36:42.265
What handsome reward?

560
36:44.425 --> 36:45.265
Please.

561
36:51.665 --> 36:52.745
This is…

562
37:03.385 --> 37:06.345
My redemption money. Spare me from hard labor,

563
37:07.145 --> 37:08.545
and all this is yours.

564
37:20.265 --> 37:22.945
All of these…

565
37:38.385 --> 37:42.065
Only fine jewels like these are worthy of a beauty like you.

566
37:43.465 --> 37:46.465
Rest assured, you won't need to labor or run about.

567
37:46.545 --> 37:48.665
You just need to pass a word to Attendant Liu over there.

568
37:48.745 --> 37:51.745
Say you've forgiven me and our families have reconciled.

569
37:51.825 --> 37:53.025
This matter will be settled.

570
37:53.105 --> 37:55.585
Such flawless pearls.

571
37:57.305 --> 37:59.105
Such beautiful gold.

572
38:00.585 --> 38:05.345
How did you know that my favorite thing in life is gold?

573
38:08.025 --> 38:08.865
HENGCHENG GATE

574
38:08.945 --> 38:12.945
Trinkets, small ornaments, come look.

575
38:14.345 --> 38:15.785
-It's mine! -Hurry!

576
38:15.865 --> 38:16.785
You…

577
38:17.905 --> 38:19.745
Wei Rao, what are you doing?

578
38:20.345 --> 38:21.465
Give it to me.

579
38:22.105 --> 38:22.945
Mine.

580
38:23.705 --> 38:24.785
Give it to me.

581
38:41.985 --> 38:43.185
What?

582
38:43.825 --> 38:45.785
Since it's mine, I can do as I please with it.

583
38:48.185 --> 38:50.025
Can't bear to part with it, Lord Han?

584
38:57.305 --> 38:58.345
It's up to you.

585
39:04.465 --> 39:09.225
-Give it to me. -It's mine.

586
39:09.305 --> 39:12.305
A bit of gold and silver to make a beauty smile.

587
39:12.385 --> 39:13.305
It's worth it.

588
39:14.225 --> 39:15.425
As long as you're happy,

589
39:16.985 --> 39:17.865
throw it.

590
39:19.705 --> 39:23.225
General Qi, please convert all the gold and silver in the chest into grain,

591
39:23.305 --> 39:26.225
send it to the city charity center, and have them set up porridge stalls.

592
39:27.585 --> 39:28.665
At your service.

593
39:34.945 --> 39:37.065
500 mu of good farmland.

594
39:41.025 --> 39:42.865
Everyone in the capital knows

595
39:42.945 --> 39:45.105
that the area below Mount Yaowang was originally a wasteland.

596
39:45.785 --> 39:48.185
Destitute refugees gathered there,

597
39:48.905 --> 39:51.905
and they reclaimed fertile fields on the barren land.

598
39:51.985 --> 39:55.425
Your family lent them seeds and farm tools,

599
39:57.025 --> 39:58.785
but before the wheat could even ripen,

600
39:58.865 --> 40:01.505
it was all seized by high-ranking officials and nobles.

601
40:02.305 --> 40:04.505
The Han family took all the good farmland.

602
40:04.585 --> 40:05.825
Free men ended up as tenant.

603
40:06.505 --> 40:08.185
90% of the grain they worked so hard to farm

604
40:08.265 --> 40:10.305
had to be handed over to you.

605
40:14.025 --> 40:17.305
Han family's good farmland?

606
40:18.665 --> 40:19.745
What a joke.

607
40:20.665 --> 40:23.665
Do you even know what you are tearing up and throwing away?

608
40:23.745 --> 40:26.345
The wealth belongs to you.

609
40:26.865 --> 40:29.465
Your land and your slaves. All yours.

610
40:30.345 --> 40:32.825
How could you destroy it yourself?

611
40:32.905 --> 40:34.945
-You… -As I said,

612
40:35.785 --> 40:37.265
all tenant farmers are set free.

613
40:38.705 --> 40:43.265
Whoever tills the soil and grows the food, the grain should rightfully be theirs.

614
40:51.745 --> 40:54.945
Father, I saw a glazed hairpin yesterday that I really like.

615
40:55.025 --> 40:56.505
It only cost 1,500 qian.

616
40:56.585 --> 40:59.665
Alright, whatever my good girl likes, I will buy it for you.

617
40:59.745 --> 41:01.385
Father, you are the best.

618
41:02.145 --> 41:03.225
Yesterday, I washed clothes at your residence.

619
41:03.305 --> 41:04.945
My pay was short by one qian.

620
41:05.025 --> 41:06.385
Please bestow it upon me, Lord.

621
41:06.465 --> 41:09.505
Nonsense! When did I ever withhold your pay? Get lost.

622
41:10.545 --> 41:11.465
It really was short by one qian.

623
41:11.545 --> 41:13.465
Without money for medicine, my mother will die.

624
41:14.345 --> 41:15.225
Drag her away.

625
41:17.265 --> 41:19.585
Lord. My Lord!

626
41:19.665 --> 41:20.505
ZHUANG'S HOUSE

627
41:32.345 --> 41:33.585
You people…

628
41:33.665 --> 41:36.425
For pearls and fine jade and lavish enjoyments,

629
41:36.505 --> 41:38.545
you won't hesitate to spend gold.

630
41:40.305 --> 41:43.385
Yet before the truly impoverished,

631
41:43.465 --> 41:45.545
even for what's rightfully theirs,

632
41:46.665 --> 41:50.025
you can be so stingy. Not one penny spent, not one inch given.

633
41:52.625 --> 41:55.665
Even after working day and night, rushing about in hardship,

634
41:56.265 --> 41:58.425
they remain destitute,

635
41:59.865 --> 42:01.545
dying of exhaustion and hunger.

636
42:04.705 --> 42:06.105
How pitiful.

637
42:07.145 --> 42:08.945
How ridiculous.

638
42:12.545 --> 42:14.385
How terrifying.

639
42:17.865 --> 42:19.025
Off you go!

640
42:26.425 --> 42:27.385
Something coming down.

641
42:28.265 --> 42:30.145
-What is this? -What is it?

642
42:30.225 --> 42:31.425
This is mine.

643
42:34.705 --> 42:36.545
Out of the way, it is all mine!

644
42:37.545 --> 42:38.585
Hurry!

645
42:38.665 --> 42:42.545
Goddess of mercy! A true saint!

646
42:45.145 --> 42:47.345
-Stop, that's mine. -It's mine.

647
42:47.425 --> 42:50.025
-Let go. -Don't tear it, it's mine.

648
42:57.105 --> 42:58.185
What is all this?

649
43:02.865 --> 43:04.385
You are all free now.

650
43:11.865 --> 43:13.825
-I got it. -It's mine.

651
43:13.905 --> 43:15.425
Just grab it first.

652
43:16.625 --> 43:19.265
It's all mine. Get out of the way.

653
43:19.345 --> 43:23.425
-It's all mine. -It's all mine.

654
43:24.025 --> 43:25.145
It's a land deed.

655
43:26.065 --> 43:27.145
She tore the land deed to pieces.

656
43:31.505 --> 43:34.465
Estates, farmland, pearls, gold, and jade…

657
43:35.385 --> 43:40.665
She actually gave up things many could only dream of.

658
43:42.385 --> 43:43.505
Lunatic.

659
43:43.585 --> 43:47.185
She is an absolute lunatic.

660
43:52.105 --> 43:54.985
However, no matter how bold she is,

661
43:55.065 --> 43:56.265
how crazy she is,

662
43:57.745 --> 43:59.905
she has reached a dead end today.

663
44:18.825 --> 44:21.465
-What are you crying for? -My Lord…

664
44:22.705 --> 44:25.265
I am asking you. What are you crying for?

665
44:35.105 --> 44:36.105
Where is her jewelry?

666
44:36.705 --> 44:40.465
She gave half to me and took all the rest with her.

667
44:43.865 --> 44:44.905
What is she doing?

668
44:47.705 --> 44:48.745
You…

669
44:48.825 --> 44:50.585
My Lord, everyone in the capital is talking.

670
44:50.665 --> 44:51.785
Madam tore up the land deeds from the Han family

671
44:51.865 --> 44:53.545
and freed all the tenant farmers.

672
44:53.625 --> 44:55.225
She sold the estate, gold, and silver for grain

673
44:55.305 --> 44:56.745
and gave it all to the refugees.

674
45:04.465 --> 45:05.705
She's never coming back.

675
45:08.185 --> 45:09.025
Right?

676
45:15.185 --> 45:16.265
Wishful thinking.

677
45:16.945 --> 45:19.305
Zhao Song, where is she?

678
45:19.385 --> 45:21.385
She should be at the charity centre now.

679
45:29.505 --> 45:31.905
Prepare the horses. Let's leave the city now.

680
45:31.985 --> 45:33.705
My Lord, aren't you looking for her Ladyship?

681
45:33.785 --> 45:34.905
Why leave the city?

682
45:35.585 --> 45:38.105
To bring her back, we must go to Mount Yaowang.

683
45:44.945 --> 45:47.105
You should've seen Han Liao's face.

684
45:47.185 --> 45:49.065
Ripping his heart out wouldn't hurt more.

685
45:49.145 --> 45:50.105
Can't believe you just did it.

686
45:50.185 --> 45:54.065
Then again, who wouldn't love wealth, lands, and slaves?

687
45:54.585 --> 45:56.665
In this world, only you could give them up.

688
45:59.625 --> 46:01.545
Qi Zhongkai, thank you.

689
46:02.585 --> 46:04.665
No need for thanks between us. You know that I…

690
46:08.505 --> 46:09.785
SILKS AND FINE FABRICS

691
46:16.745 --> 46:18.145
The guest I'm waiting for

692
46:21.665 --> 46:22.505
has arrived.

693
46:25.425 --> 46:28.625
-Who goes there? -General, they look like palace guards.

694
46:31.265 --> 46:33.865
SILKS AND FINE FABRICS

695
46:36.825 --> 46:38.665
My mistress invites you tonight.

696
46:39.425 --> 46:41.545
Please board the carriage, Lady Lu.

697
46:57.705 --> 46:59.665
The moment I stepped out of the palace,

698
47:00.305 --> 47:01.905
I knew this day would come.

699
47:02.985 --> 47:03.825
General Qi,

700
47:05.385 --> 47:06.345
thank you for today.

701
47:07.625 --> 47:08.745
Wei Rao.

702
47:09.785 --> 47:10.985
I have personal matters to handle.

703
47:11.665 --> 47:12.985
I would ask the General not to inquire further.

704
49:36.985 --> 49:39.665
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED ‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
